#: scenario2:scenario2_06F5E9DF_EEC6_449D_867F_7CCC7B9DBC15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64b54c686fc0eb42635df50bf61146ed3554e3502dec75a8abdd6f8e273f0d19
