#: scenario2:scenario2_199A37CC_E988_4B72_800C_A64861EC0549
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0392b870066716372604151c9e2c44f4e7c99d057d587edd4dfc192555b0ad1
