#: scenario2:scenario2_8673E044_1B98_4FBC_BB7C_DC6901A79B14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2982f9920ff5e2475301b9fb88551fa04fb760f2e2a9558070f7fe0fd523444
