msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Then... ⟪k:3⟫I suppose I shall take you up on your generosity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Credo... ⟪k:3⟫che approfitterò della sua generosità, allora."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4085474D_5FA7_4CF4_ABDB_FDCE6F5B07F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 042776fc0627335c1b7b08edb0a5efdafcf5d963dc9765af82db375e4c7084c0
