msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I have been wandering for a very, very long time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ho vagato per molto, molto tempo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E8E33C0F_1C5D_4935_86C2_6AEC7C6A29BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b8683aad8f071c57daf407b32a89d0825edb0161e14c9650589bdecccb71c02
#. default-sha256: 0e277a0d881119e1366f83430b8a6f02d976990451508128ed48129e1c8351ad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E8E33C0F_1C5D_4935_86C2_6AEC7C6A29BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What was that, Master? ⟪k:1⟫You recognize her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Come dice? ⟪k:1⟫La riconosce?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0789AA8F_5FF4_4FC9_AC02_874445FF7FDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98694521777b4d5fedeb15e7fec0f4e2329d1b171b6e37824a9fe60727aaa87b
#. default-sha256: ea111e996b2353ddca34759a63985469e165941d8aa4f4cf872e7862e6d6d2c3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0789AA8F_5FF4_4FC9_AC02_874445FF7FDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine you would. ⟪k:1⟫That white hair, those red eyes, skin the color of freshly fallen "
"snow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi aspettavo che l’avrebbe fatto, Padrone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quei capelli bianchi, quegli occhi "
"rossi, la pelle come neve appena caduta, e quel viso perfetto..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2E741487_927A_4B6B_8150_D002B616BB04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 589e7288a435b232e95168514555326c9cb53ebe52561f060c53d5416a03d9e0
#. default-sha256: 879b16ebf8e6e591956ca4c16908001a789c65f103349aa5de759bf0b067784b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2E741487_927A_4B6B_8150_D002B616BB04"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And that flawlessly beautiful visage... ⟪k:1⟫you could not possibly mistake her for anyone "
"else. ⟪k:2⟫And no, it is not someone who happens to resemble her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non la si potrebbe mai confondere per nessun’altra.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E no, non è qualcuna che le "
"somiglia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_58773568_08FB_4D1E_82D8_4F1AA27D2A86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb28d6e375b126959fa233110b1adced54505c3708e7403a592c870e0362d24c
#. default-sha256: a891fa87c2d08e114bc1e40ca825cf5e2d18733baec54680bd898b5af0ea69a7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_58773568_08FB_4D1E_82D8_4F1AA27D2A86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can understand why you would be surprised, Master. ⟪k:1⟫At first, I could hardly believe "
"my own eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Posso capire il motivo della sua sorpresa, Padrone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All’inizio, io stessa non "
"riuscii a credere ai miei occhi."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DE5B9B47_1A1E_40BC_B96E_D4A5B1CFF55C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e46c8d68459326384da9f33c350905c84b4778fecad39cab2fe30ca1efe6abc
#. default-sha256: 1bd0d11620e9c05ed646e501ff440f16d5328017b738bf0dba211acbd307627d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DE5B9B47_1A1E_40BC_B96E_D4A5B1CFF55C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The wanderer knocking on the door that day was the very same fair-skinned young woman who "
"visited the mansion so many years earlier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La viandante che aveva bussato alla porta quel giorno era la stessa giovane donna dalla "
"pelle chiara che visitò la villa tanti anni prima."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A12E6328_D57E_43F8_BB1B_8C4C5F88215D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3275d3306d562eba7ab591a1b49e5c2c66881c2f8025b2fb3ab8451fea015558
#. default-sha256: 6a2547e7a8a970fefde5ea462535419841ced7f69029c25c81c5875a58565a7c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A12E6328_D57E_43F8_BB1B_8C4C5F88215D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl must have spent many, many a night in the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi doveva aver trascorso molte, molte notti nella foresta."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E877D490_31D4_4AAE_A8F4_3729423D1083
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6932d1674eadd593ff9e1dd0fbb02d8c75f6604551536898e98b95edcf445ded
#. default-sha256: ac8ca661d66f4be63982a9fe1d52121211a12e22ec26620d52cb36928318e1e4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E877D490_31D4_4AAE_A8F4_3729423D1083"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her crystalline skin was covered in red scratches from where she had brushed against stray "
"branches and tree bark. She had even lost her shoes, and was standing there barefooted, looking "
"quite disheartened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La sua pelle cristallina era ricoperta da graffi rossi, laddove aveva sfiorato i rami spogli "
"e le cortecce degli alberi. Era persino rimasta senza scarpe, e se ne stava lì a piedi nudi, con "
"un’aria abbastanza scoraggiata."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CBB6BF74_20E5_4572_B7D3_72A11D316931
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df4d7b924b44bb70ab250a5358849af578a0be901d32f238f3fec84573c274f7
#. default-sha256: 9c7f917740db70c421a8cc5f51d62b99f66c7547ac0c6b64026c25c224d3a74a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CBB6BF74_20E5_4572_B7D3_72A11D316931"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that did not make her any less beautiful. In fact, you could just imagine the dense "
"forest canopy parting to allow the sun to shine down upon her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma ciò non la rendeva meno attraente. Anzi, può solo immaginare⟪k:1⟫le fitte fronde della "
"foresta che si dividevano per permettere al sole⟪k:2⟫di risplendere su di lei."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F2F71829_F774_4155_83C7_9178873C2A08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3beecc3ecb541d1d16f6cce38fd006b6677157a09cecc1e86de08b42f786da9
#. default-sha256: 1c812955ab9bac78e3a90e06d812791e1961c834f796f1436b7f9a497f0f3238
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F2F71829_F774_4155_83C7_9178873C2A08"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9F0927F3_EB0A_49F1_8830_CBE0CA231BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22413d27265d14327b58f6485679d96c96ea7bb169dd2d4908d7217fd4f4af85
#. default-sha256: ba6a466cc78b66e7d0ad945f9af6ffd546bda6c5f0c875f2eee82cb7f209218f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9F0927F3_EB0A_49F1_8830_CBE0CA231BCA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The beast appeared surprised by her angelic beauty as well. ⟪k:1⟫It seemed as though all the "
"madness drained from him in that moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anche Bestia apparve sorpreso dalla sua angelica bellezza.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In quel momento sembrò "
"come essersi svuotato di tutta la propria follia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6EF0A4AB_CE19_4C16_9E79_AFFE0E0D292A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cadbcb08fbd930be85c33b19dc96b2eefbc804e8cfc46e4a5816cbdb741b5abf
#. default-sha256: 73240080bf46069c38289e19b43c8d9b2ccd9eb4857ef2fde459e62c16247d8d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6EF0A4AB_CE19_4C16_9E79_AFFE0E0D292A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫....................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫....................."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6D4B969B_BC5B_41D1_90C0_4EC4FFA290FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c90dea0f5375dc0ca05feb0ab577a3122ff97459f0fcf1006dc95ec6fe4b1738
#. default-sha256: 285ecb7e06b059255150d1db9623fbe04391e1af5e7dfcadd7e8553d1790dca1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6D4B969B_BC5B_41D1_90C0_4EC4FFA290FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He said nothing, but his eyes told all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non disse nulla, ma i suoi occhi dicevano tutto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_856FAEE0_BDA3_42B9_8042_E2231EE27056
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0a24648e259242cc2ac8de63e25c5d26ed809ff270f487783015d50959ca29d
#. default-sha256: d44033228c0024b25b92aaa05613138813fbee182100f3cf0bd9c6531a2ccf33
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_856FAEE0_BDA3_42B9_8042_E2231EE27056"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was entranced by the sight of her ruby-red irises and her pure-white hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era incantato dalla vista delle sue iridi color rubino e dei suoi capelli bianco puro."

