#: scenario2:scenario2_7CC04AB0_BDC5_4F3D_BD21_1CD11CB78737
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90c701b13df5a4d41cbf0c8b4052ee41b673f85131fe07538f816518ac95802f
#. default-sha256: 181e53700d53d32bdc7bb249cd0b2a033158b04e43ee007f54bc03c756f1a547
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7CC04AB0_BDC5_4F3D_BD21_1CD11CB78737"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Taken in the throes of his primal urges, the beast had not noticed, but there was an "
"emptiness in the girl’s eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Presa dai propri impulsi primitivi, la bestia non se n’era accorta,⟪k:1⟫ma c’era un vuoto "
"negli occhi della ragazza."

#: scenario2:scenario2_651C1431_471A_41B0_B289_FA29C125ADDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 883a758ed751ddf26eb8101fe8d922985c0b14580ec920ac4c438c5610b4ddea
#. default-sha256: 72a4611d875f325757c59c0a78b6c170c8392ed61e8ab921ce217e39c7e9f0c5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_651C1431_471A_41B0_B289_FA29C125ADDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be gazing far into the distance, not focused on the man despite being close "
"enough to touch him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sembrava che stesse guardando lontano, senza focalizzarsi sull’uomo, nonostante fosse "
"abbastanza vicino da toccarlo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2B91BD3B_8E75_43F8_A27C_2C9A1CE8968A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1108612af71a4418da5a10e47f4d44dacdfe577f910e1c3c0b448da41f7bcd75
#. default-sha256: 894470f5978a25886499777b283e2cd39e3c4760f3a3523ce2b36b185a74f4f4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2B91BD3B_8E75_43F8_A27C_2C9A1CE8968A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tears had begun running down Bestia’s cheeks earlier—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫when she had called him a "
"person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le lacrime avevano cominciato a scorrere sulle guance di Bestia già da prima—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫da "
"quando lei aveva detto di considerarlo una persona."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A8CC8189_A609_4FA4_8E7B_3113430A1ED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a941ea2147b743c6e846031c127494350ab9482a27e630a28b7ae5cb22c7b3b
#. default-sha256: b230f0e711a6ebd2c7c6fd700196329cf23b95350679cc86adefbae2c7625f12
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A8CC8189_A609_4FA4_8E7B_3113430A1ED6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not until one of those droplets had slid across the back of her finger that she "
"had realized."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma fu solo quando una di quelle gocce scivolò sul dorso del suo dito, che lei si rese conto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BD87C6E1_2308_4BB1_B95E_E41A9B2AD812
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e741d1ff80335cba9cfe472fcfd97dd1cb690cbf94594b8e7d8b8d182a17b64b
#. default-sha256: 6c504d782fe1df8acf946fa1579646b951a431364d0b946c0257dbfe5a792009
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BD87C6E1_2308_4BB1_B95E_E41A9B2AD812"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She would, indeed, have no need of extravagant dresses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫after all, she could not "
"see what she was wearing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In effetti, non poteva aver bisogno di abiti stravaganti—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫dopotutto, non "
"sarebbe riuscita a vedere cos’avrebbe indossato."

#: scenario2:scenario2_645A19A9_4D1A_45F3_8D14_DF9B0BBD9175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a4da3311e22b0412a77c90957817d62b606e34740fcc29cbcf99a1969f0e617
#. default-sha256: 5ca5d524c59b10d8a0ee4b563a9b5f4fd674a7ad1d70663c9303db1f877d2352
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_645A19A9_4D1A_45F3_8D14_DF9B0BBD9175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That is correct; I am blind...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But who ever decided that reality is only that which "
"can be seen?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ così—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫sono cieca...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ma chi ha mai stabilito che la realtà sia "
"solo quella che può essere vista?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3520CD30_9B22_4B24_A869_88E7B38DC357
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d0b5b59a2f2ae594354fa1562ce47d207b0bbbf81a483dc1257c41713f808e1
#. default-sha256: 1d6412f73a5652c06c0dd47439deddebfb0ab0fe3176aaff4ee6e7fb96f446e8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3520CD30_9B22_4B24_A869_88E7B38DC357"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know not what appearance I have."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non so quale sia il mio aspetto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_590045A2_5DA3_4579_A391_E1875D295C2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c33fc7cc7812af2e7d05170bd76ae85a680ec5bb6c797bab5c5ed8a35a4c0f8
#. default-sha256: 0bbfc046ef714044b145a1683fa08e11e81dcc15c6b0adb703b15c62e5ab0342
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_590045A2_5DA3_4579_A391_E1875D295C2A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the darkness, everything is as one;⟪k:1⟫there is no difference between beast and man.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫If you are a beast, then I too must be a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nell’oscurità, tutti sono uguali;⟪k:1⟫non c’è differenza tra bestia e uomo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Se tu "
"sei una bestia, allora anch’io sono una bestia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D4A42BCC_B63F_4D0F_946B_5E2A96A08F12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63b2f2047a4a68d7a04b7df12d6302f08527182527e1fb64bbad862c75b4b7d2
#. default-sha256: b38e1fe2c6ab38a1b83d8fdc83b37b68f835f72e0a9f2afe61ddb1d99cfb1772
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D4A42BCC_B63F_4D0F_946B_5E2A96A08F12"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To call the girl a beast would be paramount to eating sugar and insisting it was salt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ritenere quella ragazza una bestia sarebbe stato ridicolo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫tanto quanto "
"mangiare lo zucchero e insistere nel dire che sia sale."

#: scenario2:scenario2_67032F47_2055_44A8_ABA4_DAA196713B97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e3186c75cc92d19ea6e86b9b9a76a34a2c40b5c93c42cbc2e263c5fd6e2ce29
#. default-sha256: 06357544bf8b8ffaa62fa097de8411a63d57d4d6e73c52a3c4fea5030ff181ca
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_67032F47_2055_44A8_ABA4_DAA196713B97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do pardon the trite analogy, please."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La prego di perdonare la mia banale analogia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C28C27E1_5C6E_40FF_9B28_D04C6F0819BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 472f75f5d7d40543e18fd5e9a971f072cadba7301c24a735d9fb5250746148a9
#. default-sha256: ee45048a9296542e5d53c5fb54c55b7af4e279fa5eb66a90adfb59eb30144558
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C28C27E1_5C6E_40FF_9B28_D04C6F0819BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But you know rather well, Master, that the White-Haired Girl was not at all what you would "
"call a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma Padrone, lei sa benissimo che la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi⟪k:1⟫non era affatto ciò che "
"si sarebbe potuto considerare una bestia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C5F8E918_0E88_4054_BC3A_7461BBBD5E9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da8f8d562dc21313d0af6bd6fcd29e56a8118485281c9480a9c8683938b7afca
#. default-sha256: fca056d1ecb81cd85db9527006a3ba8940a3a646e227dcc0d5f734be209d3d32
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C5F8E918_0E88_4054_BC3A_7461BBBD5E9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not simply in appearance, but all the way down to her core. There was nothing beastly about "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non solo per il suo aspetto, ma per la sua stessa essenza.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non c’era nulla di "
"feroce in lei."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C92FAF2A_FEB5_4F72_9017_4460FD097624
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ae1475a16da169ce4de8f779b20639aa772982c056b66933d9f25153aeba58f
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C92FAF2A_FEB5_4F72_9017_4460FD097624"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario2:scenario2_14B4EFA8_4CDC_4E77_9678_C64085275876
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c24f3e456a27980e56536564f5bfcd99745557c33e3b5130cdb0733254e81589
#. default-sha256: 0b6d4255a049d813b9ef6f3390ba4dd056eb3dd75c950c21ddb988447cab20fa
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_14B4EFA8_4CDC_4E77_9678_C64085275876"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her words brought him faint pain, but the beast still felt, on some level, that he wanted to "
"keep her at his side. To see what would happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le parole della donna procurarono a Bestia un certo dolore,⟪k:1⟫ma per qualche motivo, egli "
"sentiva che avrebbe voluto tenerla al proprio fianco, e vedere cosa sarebbe successo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1DBC9231_F152_4E0A_9F32_4372EB81F449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 081901c38e5eb92e75ebf6b029c75e0f5629d7d7cd9cf4546ee6a488db9b460d
#. default-sha256: a4d16126aa476019352983aeb3e445d071a7a8aa839257573bbd1d1f03dbb8d2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1DBC9231_F152_4E0A_9F32_4372EB81F449"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His next words were in large part impulsive."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le parole che seguirono, furono in larga parte istintive."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1DC255A9_C3A5_4CEE_A646_B2B4EE311868
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd1995ce8e0184bad6e926da20f0223af6c75d5661af6795caf430910847a823
#. default-sha256: 7c931996c47e84513d36ea8b471a0450153e4debe1664a881457c5f32008c64a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1DC255A9_C3A5_4CEE_A646_B2B4EE311868"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I am grateful... ⟪k:2⟫that you cannot see."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sono felice... ⟪k:1⟫che tu non possa vedere."
